    <dt>CURRAH μSPEECH programming manual (1983)</dt>
    <dd><a href="https://maziac.github.io/currah_uspeech_tests/data/currah_manual.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">https://maziac.github.io/currah_uspeech_tests/data/currah_manual.pdf</a></dd>
