    <dd><a href="https://www.spectaculator.com/docs/zx-state/uspeech.html" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">https://www.spectaculator.com/docs/zx-state/uspeech.html</a></dd>
  </dl>
  <p>These pages were a great help when working out the paging, the
  allophone set and the BASIC interface.</p>
  <p>Period reviews and features indexed on Spectrum Computing
  include Sinclair User #21 (Dec 1983) p.40; Your Spectrum #1
  (Jan 1984) p.33 and #9 (Nov 1984) p.52; Personal Computer News
  #34 (2 Nov 1983) p.39, #40 (14 Dec 1983) supplement "PCN
  Micropaedia v13 part 2: Peripherals" p.321, and #49 (18 Feb
  1984) p.36; C&amp;VG #28 (Feb 1984) p.156; ZX Computing #14
  (Aug 1984) p.33 and #17 (Feb 1985) p.115; Sinclair User Annual
  1984 p.39; Crash v1 #1 (Feb 1984) p.26 and v1 #2 (Mar 1984)
  p.42; and Computer Choice (Apr 1984) p.34.</p>
</div>
